  "summary": "统计最小公倍数恰等于 k 的连续非空子数组数量。",
  "insight": "固定左端点向右扩展并维护当前 LCM。LCM 只会保持或增大；一旦它不再是 k 的约数，继续加入元素也不可能回到 k，可立即停止。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "子数组必须连续",
    "更新 LCM 时先除 gcd 避免无谓放大",
    "当前 LCM 不整除 k 后可以剪枝"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "enumerate-left-with-rolling-lcm",
      "title": "枚举左端点并滚动计算 LCM",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "利用整除关系提前终止每次右扩。",
      "steps": [
        "对每个 left 初始化 lcm=1",
        "right 从 left 右移，lcm=lcm/gcd(lcm,nums[right])*nums[right]",
        "若 k%lcm!=0 则 break",
        "若 lcm==k 则答案加一"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n² log value)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/enumerate-left-with-rolling-lcm/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/enumerate-left-with-rolling-lcm/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/enumerate-left-with-rolling-lcm/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
